{"articleNo":"2818","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2818&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-1 강의평가 기간 연장 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.05.12","hit":"16139","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br>2011학년도 1학기 <font color=\"#0000ff\">강의평가 기간 연장</font> 안내</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2011학년도 1학기 강의평가 기간을 아래와 같이&nbsp;연장 하오니&nbsp;<br>아직 평가를 하지 못한&nbsp;학생은 빠짐없이&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">강의평가에 참여하여 성실하게 설문에 응하여 주시기 바랍니다.<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;<br><font color=\"#ff0000\" size=\"4\"><strong><a href=\"http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/login/onestop.html\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\">&gt;&gt;&gt; ☞ &nbsp;강의평가 바로가기&nbsp;<br><br></font><br></a></strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">1. 강의평가&nbsp;연장기간&nbsp; :&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2011.06.12(일) 23:59&nbsp;까지</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIG